    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "This property provides the underlying capture device for the framework’s camera feed.",
      "ko": "The figure below shows a face geometry (see [`ARSCNFaceGeometry`](arscnfacegeometry.md)) in two states, demonstrating values of `0.0` and `1.0` for this coefficient.",
      "sourceHash": "07a96f94f0812228cdcda82237cbd68f5441d3bf64831938ffe3b308903ba5d2",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "By altering the device’s configuration, your app indirectly adjusts the visual properties of the each AR frame’s [`capturedImage`](arframe/capturedimage.md).",
      "ko": "In both states, the values for all other [`ARFaceAnchor.BlendShapeLocation`](arfaceanchor/blendshapelocation.md) coefficients are set to `0.0`.",
      "sourceHash": "244fe1a86a846c5a2ea74a381fa57f8b04cdf66f0fc8837b74df0d072eba6870",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "Alter the device’s settings with caution, as extreme changes can affect ARKit’s features that rely on the [`capturedImage`](arframe/capturedimage.md) and depend on its integrity, such as people occlusion that uses [`personSegmentation`](arconfiguration/framesemantics-swift.struct/personsegmentation.md).",
      "ko": "장치의 설정은 신중하게 변경해야 합니다. 과도한 변경은 [`capturedImage`](https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/e6fbc01a3a640483d8b59d18e67b0752/media-2930066%402x.png)에 의존하고 그 무결성에 기반한 ARKit 기능(예: [`personSegmentation`](arconfiguration/framesemantics-swift.struct/personsegmentation.md) 기반 사람 가림) 에 영향을 줄 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "9097d3d89450d9c95002a2da58695b3677b9d5aacd11ae77c286aa15b3bbcefa",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "❗ **Important**: This property is `nil` on devices that aren’t equiped with an ultra-wide camera.",
      "ko": "❗ **중요**: 이 property는 울트라 와이드 카메라가 장착되지 않은 기기에서는 `nil`입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "7c77178b9fdc0481fa39d5f782a181eb907f27a00818374e357635e7efc5c881",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
